        "official_en_sha256": "1dbf61c13bf7337c72537874e61905aae41d4b9f38bb81cd926a1564a2749ab1"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "ジェイクさんたちの活躍はもちろんだけど、\r\n彼女の武器がなければ、革命は成功しなかったよ。",
        "official_en": "Jake and many others had a big impact, of course, but we’d have been lost without her weapons.",
        "real_en": "Jake-san and the others played their part,\r\nbut the revolution would never have succeeded without her weapons."
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "CHANGE"
